      skos:note "REVISED 2026-04-06: The organisation is replacing Zypherion with Meridian for analytics. Zypherion was found to have critical gaps in streaming ingestion; Meridian handles both batch and streaming natively. Migration window remains Q3 2026. Supersedes the original Zypherion adoption decision." .
  }
}
